# Build context of gateway-rust/Dockerfile is the repository root: keep it to the Cargo workspace
# (Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, core/, gateway-rust/ and the manifests + sources of the other members, which
# Cargo needs to resolve the workspace) and drop everything else.
**/target/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
**/*.md
conformance/
docs/
**/docs/
gateway-workers/
worker/tests/
worker/scripts/
worker/build*/
worker/package.json
worker/package-lock.json
worker/wrangler.toml
scripts/
